        "r": 541.4648799999995,
        "b": 235.86610136319496
      },
      "content": "The first interface in left shown in  Figure 3-32 (BATTMP) is the temperature sensor interface of battery and temperature sensor of battery shall connect external battery cabinet."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0337",
      "reading_order": 412,
