        "r": 425.31568,
        "b": 204.63610136319494
      },
      "content": "Arrangements  of  battery  temperature  sensor  pins  are  shown  in  Figure 3-32."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0338",
      "reading_order": 413,
      "section": "3.9.3 External Battery Temperature Detection Interface",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 198.50766291015634,
        "r": 312.84568,
        "b": 189.03610136319492
      },
      "content": "Pin 1: + 5 V (power supply of temperature sensor)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0339",
      "reading_order": 414,
      "section": "3.9.3 External Battery Temperature Detection Interface",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 182.90766291015632,
        "r": 271.32568,
        "b": 173.4361013631949
      },
      "content": "Pin 2: BAT-T (battery temperature single)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0340",
      "reading_order": 415,
      "section": "3.9.3 External Battery Temperature Detection Interface",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 167.3076629101563,
        "r": 263.74568,
        "b": 157.83610136319498
      },
      "content": "Pin 3 ~ 8 is empty, they are unused."
    },
